      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Depends on this issue as policies will need to be able to test for the individual relationships API methods (as XACML actions); currently they can't as the individual methods are not exposed as actions in the PEP.</p>",
